===Verb===
{{en-verb|befuddl}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[perplex]], [[confuse]] (someone).
#: {{ux|en|The explanation left him completely '''befuddled'''.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[stupefy]] (someone), especially with [[alcohol]].
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1983|author=Basile Kerblay|title=Modern Soviet Society|page=290|passage=... to the American and French alcoholics, who drink in order to get drunk and '''befuddle''' the brain}}

